 5 呎或射程 60 呎，單一目標。{@h}17（{@damage 5d6}）火焰傷害。"],"name_zh":"灰燼爆發","_zhOf":"Ashen Burst"},{"name":"Cinder Spite {@recharge 5}","entries":["夏梅茵以自身 120 呎內它能看見的一點為中心，製造一場魔法火焰爆炸。以該點為中心、半徑 20 呎球形範圍內的每個生物，必須進行一次 {@dc 17} 敏捷豁免檢定，豁免失敗受到 35（{@damage 10d6}）火焰傷害，成功則傷害減半。因這傷害而生命值降至 0 的類人生物會死亡，並變成一尊微型木炭小雕像。"],"name_zh":"餘燼之恨 {@recharge 5}","_zhOf":"Cinder Spite {@recharge 5}"}],"reactionNote":"Charmayne can take up to three reactions per round but only one per turn.","reaction":[{"name":"Elemental Rebuke","entries":["被攻擊命中時，夏梅茵以火族語吐出一個字，對攻擊者造成 10（{@damage 3d6}）火焰傷害。夏梅茵隨後連同穿戴或攜帶的所有裝備傳送至多 30 呎，抵達一處它能看見的未被佔據空間，並在剛離開的空間留下一團無害的灰燼與餘火。"],"name_zh":"元素斥責","_zhOf":"Elemental Rebuke"},{"name":"Fiery Counterspell","entries":["夏梅茵打斷自身 60 呎內一個它能看見且正在施法的生物。若該法術為 4 環或更低，它失敗且沒有任何效果。若該法術為 5 環或更高，夏梅茵進行一次智力檢定（{@dc 10} + 該法術的環數）。成功時，該法術失敗且沒有效果。無論法術環數為何，若法術失敗，施法者受到 10（{@damage 3d6}）火焰傷害。"],"name_zh":"烈焰反制法術","_zhOf":"Fiery Counterspell"}],"tokenCustom":true,"traitTags":["Legendary Resistances"],"actionTags":["Multiattack"],"languageTags":["C","DR","E","IG"],"damageTags":["F"],"spellcastingTags":["O"],"miscTags":["AOE"],"conditionInflictSpell":["invisible"],"savingThrowForced":["dexterity"],"savingThrowForcedSpell":["wisdom"],"hasToken":true,"hasFluff":true,"name_zh":"夏梅茵·戴摩爾","_zhOf":"Charmayne Daymore"},{"name":"Clockwork Defender","source":"KftGV","page":85,"size":["M"],"type":"construct","alignment":["U"],"ac":[{"ac":17,"from":["天生護甲"]}],"hp":{"average":42,"formula":"5d8 + 20"},"speed":{"walk":30},"str":16,"dex":15,"con":18,"int":3,"wis":14,"cha":1,"skill":{"perception":"+6","stealth":"+4"},"passive":16,"immune":["poison"],"conditionImmune":["charmed","exhaustion","frightened","paralyzed","petrified","poisoned"],"languages":["懂得其創造者的語言，但無法說話"],"cr":"1","trait":[{"name":"Unusual Nature","entries":["發條防衛者不需要空氣、食物、飲水或睡眠。"],"name_zh":"異常本質","_zhOf":"Unusual Nature"}],"action":[{"name":"Electrified Bite","entries":["{@atk mw} 命中 {@hit 5}，觸及 5 呎，單一目標。{@h}7（{@damage 1d8 + 3}）穿刺傷害外加 7（{@damage 2d6}）閃電傷害。若目標是生物，它必須成功通過一次 {@dc 13} 力量豁免檢定，否則陷入{@condition grappled||被擒}狀態（脫逃 {@dc 13}）。被發條防衛者{@condition grappled||擒抱}的生物在發條防衛者每個回合開始時再次受到該傷害。發條防衛者同時只能以此方式{@condition grappled||擒抱}一個生物，且擒抱期間無法進行帶電啃咬攻擊。"],"name_zh":"帶電啃咬","_zhOf":"Electrified Bite"}],"bonus":[{"name":"Light Beam","entries":["發條防衛者的雙眼朝 60 呎錐形區域發出明亮光照，或關閉這道光。"],"name_zh":"光束","_zhOf":"Light Beam"}],"tokenCustom":true,"traitTags":["Unusual Nature"],"languageTags":["CS"],"damageTags":["L","P"],"miscTags":["AOE","MW"],"conditionInflict":["grappled"],"savingThrowForced":["strength"],"hasToken":true,"hasFluff":true,"name_zh":"發條防衛者","_zhOf":"Clockwork Defender"},{"name":"Clockwork Observer","source":"KftGV","page":85,"size":["T"],"type":"construct","alignment":["U"],"ac":[{"ac":14,"from":["天生護甲"]}],"hp":{"average":7,"formula":"2d4 + 2"},"speed":{"walk":0,"fly":{"number":30,"condition":"（懸浮）"},"canHover":true},"str":1,"dex":16,"con":13,"int":3,"wis":15,"cha":1,"skill":{"perception":"+6"},"senses":["darkvision 60 ft."],"passive":16,"immune":["poison"],"conditionImmune":["charmed","exhaustion","frightened","paralyzed","petrified","poisoned"],"languages":["懂得其創造者的語言，但無法說話"],"cr":"0","trait":[{"name":"Flyby","entries":["發條觀察者飛出敵人的觸及範圍時不會引發藉機攻擊。"],"name_zh":"飛掠","_zhOf":"Flyby"},{"name":"Telepathic Bond","entries":["發條觀察者位於其創造者 1 哩內時，能以魔法將所見傳達給創造者，且兩者可以用心靈感應交流。"],"name_zh":"心靈連結","_zhOf":"Telepathic Bond"},{"name":"Unusual Nature","entries":["發條觀察者不需要空氣、食物、飲水或睡眠。"],"name_zh":"異常本質","_zhOf":"Unusual Nature"}],"action":[{"name":"Shriek","entries":["發條觀察者發出機械尖鳴，直到它的下個回合開始或生命值降至 0 為止。這尖鳴聲在 300 呎範圍內都聽得見。"],"name_zh":"尖叫","_zhOf":"Shriek"}],"tokenCustom":true,"traitTags":["Flyby","Unusual Nature"],"senseTags":["D"],"languageTags":["CS"],"hasToken":true,"hasFluff":true,"name_zh":"發條觀察者","_zhOf":"Clockwork Observer"},{"name":"Conservatory Student","source":"KftGV","page":110,"_copy":{"name":"Noble","source":"MM","_mod":{"action":{"mode":"removeArr","names":"Rapier"}}},"ac":[11],"skill":{"performance":"+7"},"reaction":null,"tokenCust